00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.270 align:start position:0%
 
thank you very much charlie  and welcome everybody today we're going  to be talking about the applied  biosystems  magnamax core nucleic acid purification  kit  so i'm very excited to present to you  the newest  product from applied biosystems animal  health  sample preparation portfolio and the  magmax core product is  truly a unique concept when we  set out to develop this product we're  really looking at  four things to offer labs first  flexibility second familiarity  third a reduction in waste  and then finally an opportunity for labs  to develop  new testing applications and so  that's how we came up with the magmax  core  concept which at its base starts out  at a core chemical formulation  highly universal and flexible in nature  and then what we've done is added  application specific modules  that can be coupled with the core  chemistry to create  unique applications for labs to use  today  and in the future  so we talk about the value that magmax  core  nucleic acid purification kit brings to  the market  we like to say that magmax core has been  designed  for three purposes one to accelerate  two to optimize and three to evolve  when we talk about accelerate the value  that this product brings  to our customers is less preparation  time  faster nucleic acid extraction time  and a higher level of sensitivity and  what that means to you  is higher volume consistent quality rna  and dna  extracted material ready for your  testing environment  so when we talk about optimizing what  really trying to do is improve  efficiency  for your lab and one of the things we  looked at  is reducing overall waste and by  reducing the number of washes  in the chemical formulation of magmax  core we've  done two things one is we've eliminated  the amount of  reagents used for a particular  workflow and secondly by eliminating  wash steps  we've actually reduced the plastics used  with your nucleic acid purification  instrumentation  secondly we delivered products that are  able to be shipped  and stored at room temperature thereby  reducing  unnecessary cost and space associated  with refrigerators and freezers and then  lastly  we developed a truly universal solution  that can be used in a wide range of  applications  and on a wide range of animal types  and finally when we say that magmax  score  is designed to evolve what that means is  that it can actually  evolve with your testing needs a core  chemistry  that's highly universal that can grow  with your testing needs by adding  additional  nucleic acid purification modules means  that  magmax core could truly be the very last  sample preparation  product your lab may ever need  so additionally we spent significant  time  ensuring that magmax core nucleic acid  purification kit  really delivered in best-in-class  performance  and after months and months of design  and development  we were able to ensure that you the  customer will be able to achieve high  quality extractions  regardless of sample size  and in terms of the modules that are  available for magmax score  we currently have two different modules  first is our mastitis and pan bacteria  module  which can aid in the processing of  bacteria  especially those critical in mastitis  as well as challenging matrices like  acidic milk  and then secondly we've offered the  mechanical lysis module  which aids in the processing of hard to  lyse organisms such as  map and bovine tuberculosis  in feces milk as well as an  environmental samples  and these are just the first two modules  that we've developed  in the months and years to come there'll  be plenty more  offerings for magmax core  we also spent a good deal of time  focusing on the format  of the magmax core kit when we talk  about format we really looked at  three unique areas one were the  components themselves  secondly the technology and science  behind the formulation of the product  and finally  ergonomics and usability so in terms of  the components  we offer two different kit sizes one 100  reaction kit  and the other a 500 reaction kit we've  also  ensured that no additional alcohols need  to be needed  need to be used for this kit so all  washes  are pre-mixed with alcohol from a  technology standpoint  we spent years optimizing the magnetic  beads used in this kit  to ensure that you will have superior  bead performance  and in terms of the overall reagent  formulation itself  it's a compatible formulation that's not  only used in qpcr workflows  but it's also compatible in sequencing  applications as well  and then finally from an ergonomic  standpoint  we've ensured that the formulation can  be shipped and stored  at room temperature which adds  convenience  time and cost savings and we've reduced  the washes  to only two which eliminates unnecessary  reagents  as well as plastics  and in terms of the sample types that  are validated with this particular kit  at the time of development we were able  to optimize  the magmax core nucleic acid  purification kit  on more animal matrices than any other  kit on the market  which means that your lab has extreme  levels of  flexibility and regardless of what  sample type comes into your doors  you can feel confident that magmax core  is going to be able to provide you  the solution and performance that you  need  in terms of instrument workflows we've  developed four  optimized workflows to address all of  those sample types listed before  we have a simple workflow which is used  for liquid sample matrices that  require little processing steps  we have a digestion workflow which is  for sample matrices that require  pk digestion we have a complex workflow  which are for those matrices that  require a clarification step  and then finally we have a lysis  incubation workflow  for samples such as ear punches that  come in a lysis solution  in terms of instrumentation we ensured  that the product can be used on all  available  kingfisher nucleic acid purification  instrumentation including  the kingfisher flex the kickfisher duo  prime  the kingfisher ml and the magmax express  96  thereby giving labs flexibility and  ensuring that whatever instrument they  have in their lab  is going to be compatible with our  magmax core kits  and in order to minimize overall  instrument run time  we spend a good deal of time ensuring  that we optimize the on instrument  scripts  so there's actually two available  scripts on each one of the kingfisher  instrumentation we have a heated script  with a 27 minute runtime  and a non-heated script that offers a 36  minute runtime  as i said these are common scripts that  can be used across all kingfisher  instruments  and offering heated as well as  non-heated  options for labs  so in summary magmax core  is going to enable your lab to  accelerate  by offering faster and fewer steps  optimize by delivering a universal  sample prep  with less waste to evolve  by delivering one trusted chemistry that  can grow and expand with your testing  needs  to deliver high performance by offering  consistent  and high quality extracted nucleic acid  so i'll leave you today with ordering  information for all of our core kits and  modules  this includes the individual modules as  well as  combination kits and all ancillary and  additional products  that can help support the selected  workflow of your choice  thank you very much for your time it was  a pleasure speaking with you today  and if you have any questions or need  more information  please don't hesitate to visit the  animal health booth  i believe we have some time for  additional q a  so i'll hand it back to you charlie

